1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:05,433
Tuesday. Four-twelve in the afternoon. One of your cars goes through a toll.

2
00:00:05,733 --> 00:00:08,021
Nobody pays. Not yet.

3
00:00:08,320 --> 00:00:11,992
The bill shows up three weeks later. With your name on it.

4
00:00:13,142 --> 00:00:17,467
By then the renter is gone. Deposit refunded. Rental closed.

5
00:00:17,767 --> 00:00:21,439
So you pay. And you call it the cost of doing business.

6
00:00:21,739 --> 00:00:25,176
Same with the camera ticket. The fuel. The dent.

7
00:00:26,326 --> 00:00:31,592
But the car knew. Its GPS was at that gantry, at that second.

8
00:00:31,892 --> 00:00:34,415
And the booking knew who was driving.

9
00:00:34,714 --> 00:00:39,927
MyEZToll puts those two together. Then it collects, from the renter's card.

10
00:00:41,078 --> 00:00:44,907
One small fleet. One week. Four hundred twelve dollars.

11
00:00:45,207 --> 00:00:47,547
That was going to be yours to swallow.

12
00:00:47,846 --> 00:00:52,040
You pay nothing. And you get a share of everything that comes back.

13
00:00:52,341 --> 00:00:54,629
Stop losing. Start earning.
